# Normalize every text file to LF, in the working tree and on checkout.
#
# Why this file exists: Git for Windows defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which
# rewrites text files to CRLF on checkout. The frozen runtime modules and the
# committed LF fixtures are checked against their recorded content digests, so
# without this pin a fresh Windows clone would fail those checks and the LF
# fixture assertions. With it, the working tree is byte-identical on Windows,
# macOS and Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary container fixtures: never touch these.
*.xlsx binary
*.whl binary
